"""Pry Sports Betting Intelligence - generated by the Actor Factory.

PPE runtime: charges 'betting-intel-generated' per processed URL via
push_data, respects user spending limits (event_charge_limit_reached), and
flushes completed work on platform abort. See ACTOR-FACTORY.md for methodology.

For each input URL (ESPN / odds API endpoint) the actor builds one
comprehensive betting-intelligence report per event: multi-book odds,
arbitrage, +EV, player props, live state, sharp money signals, weather
impact, prediction-market cross-reference, and Kelly criterion sizing -
selected by the ``report_type`` input.
"""

